<title>HONG KONG: Trading of Shun Shing shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading of Shun Shing shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of construction and property development firm Shun Shing Holdings Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Monday.  </p>
<p>On Friday, Shun Shing shares fell HK$0.02 or 5.97 percent to end at HK$0.315 per share.</p>
<p>Last month, the company had won a HK$267 million contract to build a new multi-services complex at the Yan Chai Hosiptal in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
